{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/supportedversions"]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The range of Swift versions this SDK is built and tested against."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"SupportedVersions"}],"platforms":["Linux"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","type":"heading","anchor":"overview","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The floor enforces itself: SwiftPM reads "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"swift-tools-version"},{"type":"text","text":" before it resolves"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"anything, and an older toolchain refuses the package outright with a clear message."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Nothing enforces the upper end — a package declaring tools-version 5.9 resolves and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"builds on a Swift 6 toolchain whether or not anybody ever compiled it there, and the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"differences that matter (strict concurrency, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sendable"},{"type":"text","text":" inference, isolation checking)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"are exactly the ones that surface as errors only once someone tries."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"These values name both ends, so a build script or a compatibility note can report the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"range without hardcoding numbers that go stale."}]},{"text":"Two manifests","type":"heading","anchor":"Two-manifests","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The package ships "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Package.swift"},{"type":"text","text":" (tools-version 5.9) "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"and"}]},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Package@swift-6.0.swift"},{"type":"text","text":" (tools-version 6.0). SwiftPM selects by toolchain, which is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"what lets the SDK keep a 5.9 floor while compiling its own targets in "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Swift 6","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"language mode","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" wherever a 6.x toolchain is present — full strict-concurrency checking"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"as errors, without dropping consumers still on 5.9."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"VersionPolicyTests","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" asserts these values against both manifests and the CI matrix, so"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"none of them can drift."}]}]}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"sections":[],"metadata":{"externalID":"s:8AxiamSDK17SupportedVersionsO","title":"SupportedVersions","symbolKind":"enum","modules":[{"name":"AxiamSDK"}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"SupportedVersions"}],"roleHeading":"Enumeration","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"SupportedVersions"}]},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/SupportedVersions","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"topicSections":[{"title":"Type Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/SupportedVersions\/isSwiftSixLanguageMode","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/SupportedVersions\/minimumSwiftToolsVersion","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/SupportedVersions\/newestTestedSwift"]}],"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/SupportedVersions/newestTestedSwift":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","t